{"unit_id":"Lucky020__dsh-copyright-kit#feature-1","repo":"Lucky020/dsh-copyright-kit","commit":"c7adba66562de9527b73aeecc164d82c76dc3383","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-copyright-kit 的功能「源程序材料」：从指定仓库收集源码并生成 Word 鉴别文档，超过页数上限时取前后部分。通过 copyright_source_doc 工具触发，可设置软件名、版本、输出位置和排除路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:73-135","lib/python/srcgen.py:111-153"]}
{"unit_id":"Lucky020__dsh-copyright-kit#feature-2","repo":"Lucky020/dsh-copyright-kit","commit":"c7adba66562de9527b73aeecc164d82c76dc3383","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-copyright-kit 的功能「说明书排版」：把 JSON spec 中的章节、段落、列表、表格和图片排成 Word 说明书。通过 copyright_manual 工具提交 spec 和输出路径，可选从源码抽取附录信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:138-194","lib/python/manualgen.py:428-475"]}
{"unit_id":"Lucky020__dsh-copyright-kit#feature-3","repo":"Lucky020/dsh-copyright-kit","commit":"c7adba66562de9527b73aeecc164d82c76dc3383","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-copyright-kit 的功能「界面截图」：读取包含多个屏幕配置的 JSON spec，渲染统一控制台布局并调用 Chrome 输出 PNG。通过 copyright_screens 工具触发，可指定输出目录与页面尺寸。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:196-254","lib/screens.js:280-315"]}
{"unit_id":"Lucky020__dsh-copyright-kit#feature-4","repo":"Lucky020/dsh-copyright-kit","commit":"c7adba66562de9527b73aeecc164d82c76dc3383","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-copyright-kit 的功能「批量出件」：按 manifest 为多个项目生成源程序文档、可选截图和说明书及申请信息。调用 copyright_pack 返回每项状态；单项失败会记录并继续。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:326-402","lib/pack.js:37-144"]}
